This exception applies only to software that executes on the VC-1
Computer System and does not apply to software that implements,
emulates, reimplements, or derives from the VC-1 Computer System,
its CPU, assembler, runtime system, or other components of this
software.

This exception does not grant permission to modify, distribute,
or create derivative works of the VC-1 Computer System source code
